				<wikidot:authorName>Smaugnolia</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1423461</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Humans are the only animal that uses canteens, so they would be afflicted most often, but I did say &quot;If a human or other animal&quot;.<br /> After that I simply refer to the victim as the &quot;subject&quot;. I never specify whether the &quot;subject&quot; is human or not. Plenty of animals have stomachs and the ability to experience peritonitis and severe internal bleeding.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
