								<wikidot:authorUserId>1313607</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is ridiculous. I like it.</p> <p>If this were a touch more &quot;AN ANIMAL BUT MAGIC&quot; or anything that wasn't polecats it might be awful&#8212; as is it sounds like a randomly generated passphrase or a crappy Animal Planet joke&#8230; that somehow makes for an interesting SCP.</p> <p><strong>Edit:</strong> I agree with the criticism of the last few lines, though. The body horror is a lot more cringey if it isn't all listed so explicitly. Because if you're that specific, I just end up wondering what role stomach acid should be playing, here&#8230;</p> 
				 	]]>
